# ---- Secrets ----
# This repository is public. Nothing here may hold a real credential: a key that
# is committed once is in the history forever, even after a later commit deletes
# it, and fork/clone copies keep it alive.
#
# Test fixtures that genuinely need a key (mobile/core/xssh-core/src/ssh.rs) use
# a key generated for publication, never a personal one.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
id_ecdsa
id_ecdsa.*
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*.kdbx